1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,700
Cześć!

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,860
Hi, so I am standing now
in the Olympic Stadium.

3
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:13,320
However, the Olympic Games
never happened here,

4
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:17,420
but you still can find
the Olympic Games slogan:

5
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,780
Citius, Altius, Fortius,
which means

6
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:23,960
stronger, faster, higher.

7
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:29,560
And I recommend coming
to this amazing structure

8
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:34,200
that was built in the years
1926 to 1928.

9
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:40,840
It serves mainly as an exercise
practice place for

10
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:44,900
the German athletes preparing

11
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,100
for the Olympic Games
in Los Angeles.

12
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:52,200
Since then this stadium went
through lots of renovations.

13
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,400
Throughout the years
it was expanded,

14
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:59,200
and today it's mainly
hosting football games,

15
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,260
American football games

16
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:04,340
and speed racing
with motorcycles

17
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:08,480
that I heard is
very crazy

18
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:12,760
and exciting, and

19
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:15,680
I have to come back here
to watch one of those races.

20
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:19,020
I recommend also just
walking around this complex

21
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:22,500
that is filled
with sports facilities.

22
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:27,780
And also you can bike to
the Oder River not far from here.

23
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:32,080
And don't forget, before you start,
to have a coffee and a cake

24
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:35,240
in Mała Czarna,
just in the entrance

25
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:38,220
to the Olympic complex, and

26
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:41,300
have a coffee and a cake,
and then don't forget

27
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,940
to run in order
to compensate for that.

28
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:46,660
Anyway, I'll see you
in the next video.

29
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:48,200
Do widzenia!
